{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/signal-2026-11-03-16-29-48-728-1-819x1024.jpg\" width=\"819\"/></figure>\n<p><strong>黃之鋒認串謀勾結外國勢力案，本周四早上9時30分在高等法院判刑，有8至9名旁聽人士今（3日）午後已到高院門外排隊。她們憶述，在支聯會案9月聆訊中，絕大部分能夠入正庭旁聽的為「排隊黨」，故她們今早一得悉黃之鋒案判刑日期，就準備好軟墊、摺凳等，到場搶先排隊。</strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>當中前來旁聽的婆婆趙美英（音譯）說「驚啲人排隊，攞晒啲飛呀嘛」，故「衫都未換」就前來排隊。她自嘲：「而家聽審，好似做賊咁，係咪呀？直頭唔敢周圍講畀人聽，一講就驚洩露咗機密，我活咗香港70幾年，未試過咁荒唐，要瞓四晚通宵先至聽到個審⋯⋯離晒大譜。」</p>\n<p>對於有大批疑似排隊黨人士搶佔正庭位置，趙婆婆揚言：「（排隊）一個禮拜都陪佢玩呀！⋯⋯我哋而家要等到差佬嚟咗，登記完先至去食嘢，我哋都未食嘢，今日同佢拼過，哈哈哈哈。」</p>\n<p>法院：高等法院 <br/>法官：法官譚耀豪<br/>被告：黃之鋒 <br/>控罪：串謀勾結外國或者境外勢力危害國家安全罪 <br/>案件編號：HCCC181/2026</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:21.474659+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":431,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:06:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T06:58:32.743613+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:39.187481+00:00","content_hash":"3f1956047bbecabe9e6247ba0f351d8b6be5cdff00d176c76598c47853292620","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}